 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Start': Heading For The Medical Frigate, Strike Planning, Squadron Assignments ('Squadass') and 'Usually Battle Plan (depends, I may put in Menace Fades though against RalOp or TDIGWATT)'; all are already listed in their sections, so the Start section is not counted again. The objective Rebel Strike Team / Garrison Destroyed (posted 'Rebel Strike Team/Garrison not Destroyed') is listed at the top.",
  "The posted list totals 61 cards (Objective 1, Locations 7, Characters 26, Ships 6, Interrupts 10, Effects 7, Weapons 1, Admiral's Order 1), not 60; kept as published.",
  "Posted 'GS 3' dested Green Squadron 3 (there is no Gold Squadron 3); 'GS 1' dested Green Squadron 1 (matching starship for Green Leader, who is in the deck) rather than Gold Squadron 1.",
  "Posted \"Chewie's Gun\" dested Chewbacca's Bowcaster; 'Squadass' dested Squadron Assignments; 'Kensaric', 'Greeve', 'Junkin' dested Corporal Kensaric, Lieutenant Greeve, Sergeant Junkin; 'Obi-wan w/Saber' dested Obi-Wan With Lightsaber (Enhanced Premiere).",
  "Posted 'Coruscant' dested Coruscant (Light) (Special Edition), the only Light Coruscant system printed by April 2001; 'Endor' dested Endor (Light).",
  "The post notes he does not own Tala 1, Tala 2 or Lieutenant Blount. The same author posted 'Rebel Strike Team V 2 0' two days later (DeckTech 15485), a revised list."
